<title>GREECE: Agriculture Spyrou trade debut July 28.</title>
<headline>Agriculture Spyrou trade debut July 28.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek seeds grower Agriculture Spyrou SA makes its trading debut on the bourse's small-cap parallel market on Monday, July 28.</p>
<p>Agriculture Spyrou went public at 1,350 drachmas a share in June, its IPO subscribed over 40 times.</p>
<p>It tapped the market for 1.012 billion drachmas with an offering of 750,000 common bearer shares with a par value of 100 drachmas.</p>
<p>Issue adviser and lead underwriter was the Bank of Piraeus.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
